{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウオッフォン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかなんかなんか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答大量な気がするよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長いよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！焼きトマト美味でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼くだけなのに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服はスカートか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ズボンだとどっちが多い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年中履けるズボンは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんあります‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服というか、スカートも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースもけっこうあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちってなに？(´・ω・`)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーいぶ前なんとなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変な擬音を書いてたんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある時パソコンで「がうっ」の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「っ」を打ちすぎてたら最後「ち」を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えて打ってしまったのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まりです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっちがうっち笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランニングは好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってかしてない;("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝しよっと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツorシャツどっち派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちもすき！決められん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今シャツのボタン上まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっちりとめたスタイルすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかちゃんファンになっていい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！応援よろしくお願いします><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし自分の好きな服のデザインが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"商品になるとしたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなイメージの服？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手作り感があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毒々しくてかわいらしいのかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイブームって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝スムージー作って飲むこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいお店探し。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他に、まりかちゃんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意料理って何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない...って言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメでしょうか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らしとかするようになった時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれなのをちょいちょいっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作れるようになりたい。本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメした人の名前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って覚えてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えてたらその名前で行きます( ・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントしてくださる方は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとわかります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ど忘れもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれ担当万理華の秋に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"注目してるアイテムは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんですかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0