マにはトンカツとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作ってもらってたなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いとうちゃんず片割れの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元岐阜にはいったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお口をあけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるのですか？(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわけ...っっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいものを見るのがすきだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガラスケースに飾られた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キッチュでカラフルな雑貨を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るのがすきだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その雑貨達を両手いっぱいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱えてみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボロボロこぼれ落ちるくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにゃのこの夢だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーお部屋をかわいいもので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいにしたいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25